 			<p>“How old is he?”</p>
 			<p>“Sixteen or seventeen, I should say,” replied another voice.</p>
 			<p>“It would be a grand thing for one of those girls, wouldn’t it? Sallie says they are very intimate now, and the old man quite dotes on them.”</p>
